    {
      "fileName": "barrier-of-boreal-frost.json",
      "id": "5FVTySSg0uYaLtMA",
      "name": "Barrier of Boreal Frost",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "5FVTySSg0uYaLtMA",
        "folder": "0fhAW241eTRrTrTa",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Barrier of Boreal Frost",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 3
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You form an intricate structure of ice, such as a wall of bricks made of packed snow or a screen of enormous icicles. This has the effect of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall of Ice] spell with a spell rank equal to half your level rounded up. It can only be a wall (not a hemisphere), and you choose whether the ice is transparent or opaque. The wall lasts until the end of your next turn, but you can Sustain it up to 1 minute.</p>"
          },
