    {
      "fileName": "body-of-air.json",
      "id": "34mcF1rw3mvntv8Y",
      "name": "Body of Air",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "34mcF1rw3mvntv8Y",
        "folder": "0fhAW241eTRrTrTa",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Body of Air",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "reaction"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><span class=\"action-glyph\">R</span> or <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy you can observe targets you with an attack or other damaging effect.</p><hr /><p>Your gathered air consumes your body, leaving only a cloud of living vapor. This has the same effects on you as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vapor Form]. The effect lasts until the end of your next turn, but you can Sustain the form up to 5 minutes. If you activate your kinetic aura, Body of Air ends.</p>\n<p>You can use Body of Air as a reaction only when the trigger is met, but you can use it as a 2-action activity without the trigger being met.</p><hr /><p><strong>Level (+1)</strong> The resistance increases by 1.</p>"
          },
